From: Gravity Linux maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] apple: import neo-bringup through 29272e482c6

Delta from the packaged Gravity base a2f6913694ff26908c16948af3f8372429782263
to GravityLinux/u-boot neo-bringup 29272e482c6c54409263478436678bbddd31e477.
Includes T8140 memory mapping, Neo USB2 PHY and host takeover/shutdown,
MTP firmware preservation, longer boot arguments, and bring-up documentation.
Original commit authorship and history are available at the pinned source URL.

